## Category: Commander
## Title: Commander Threat
## Author: Devin
## Version: 2.1.0
## Notes: Role-adaptive threat meter. Pick Tank, Damage, or Healer and the board reshapes: distance-to-pull bars and aggro warnings for damage and healers, grip and chaser watch with loose-mob counts for tanks. Full bar width is the pull point. Draw it full, compact, on your target frame, inside Commander Meters, or not at all.
